- Added the full redemption reservation persistence stack to protect tenant balances: new JPA entity/table with RLS (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/data/models/LoyaltyRedemptionReservation.java:1`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/resources/db/migrations/V20260130__loyalty_redemption_reservations.sql:1`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/resources/db/migrations/verify_rls_policies.sql:60`), tenant-scoped repository helpers (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/data/repositories/LoyaltyRedemptionReservationRepository.java:16`), and a scheduled cleanup job that sweeps expired holds across tenants (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/loyalty/LedgerJob.java:17`).
- Extended the loyalty domain service and DTOs so cart summaries honor reservations and expirations: `LoyaltyService` now exposes reservation lifecycle APIs plus improved cart projections (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/loyalty/LoyaltyService.java:672` & `946`), `CartLoyaltyProjection`/`CartLoyaltySummary` gained available/reserved balance, per-point value, and warning fields (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/loyalty/CartLoyaltyProjection.java:20`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/api/types/CartLoyaltySummary.java:23`), and `CartMapper`/Qute slider wiring stores and renders the new data with currency-aware UI (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/mappers/CartMapper.java:120`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/resources/templates/components/loyalty-panel.html:21`). `LoyaltyTransactionRepository` also gained member-specific expiration queries (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/data/repositories/LoyaltyTransactionRepository.java:35`) to feed warnings.
- Surfaced the new capabilities through the API: storefront endpoints now expose reservation create/release and the cart summary (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/api/rest/LoyaltyResource.java:227`), and the OpenAPI contract documents the endpoints plus the richer loyalty summary payload and reservation DTOs (`api/v1/openapi.yaml:3046`, `api/v1/openapi.yaml:5990`).
- Refreshed the admin SPA and Qute storefront to match requirements: the Vue dashboard now includes a pilot-gated program builder with tier editing, reward previews, and save plumbing via the updated API/store (`modules/core-platform/src/main/webui/src/modules/loyalty/views/LoyaltyDashboard.vue:45`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/webui/src/modules/loyalty/store.ts:107`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/webui/src/modules/loyalty/api.ts:17`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/webui/src/composables/useI18n.ts:134`). The cart panel now surfaces available/reserved balances, expiration warnings, and a currency-aware slider (`modules/core-platform/src/main/resources/templates/components/loyalty-panel.html:21`).
- Expanded coverage to the new flows (reservation creation, release, consumption, summary warnings) in `LoyaltyServiceTest` (`modules/core-platform/src/test/java/villagecompute/storefront/loyalty/LoyaltyServiceTest.java:383`) and recorded task completion (`.codemachine/artifacts/tasks/tasks_I4.json:56`).

